[1969.764118, "o", "    30\t\tName         string            `toml:\"name\"`\r\n    31\t\tCommand      string            `toml:\"command\"`\r\n    32\t\tDependencies []string          `toml:\"dependencies\"`\r\n    33\t\tInputs       []string          `toml:\"inputs\"`\r\n    34\t\tOutputs      []string          `toml:\"outputs\"`\r\n    35\t\tEnv          map[string]string `toml:\"env\"`\r\n    36\t\tTimeout      int               `toml:\"timeout\"`\r\n    37\t}\r\n    38\t\r\n    39\ttype Config struct {\r\n    40\t\tPipeline PipelineConfig `toml:\"pipeline\"`\r\n    41\t\tTargets  []TargetConfig `toml:\"targets\"`\r\n"]
[1969.764286, "o", "    42\t}\r\n    43\t\r\n    44\ttype CacheEntry struct {\r\n    45\t\tCacheKey   string   `json:\"cache_key\"`\r\n    46\t\tTargetName string   `json:\"target_name\"`\r\n    47\t\tTimestamp  string   `json:\"timestamp\"`\r\n    48\t\tOutputs    []string `json:\"outputs\"`\r\n    49\t}\r\n    50\t\r\n    51\ttype BuildTargetReport struct {\r\n    52\t\tName       string `json:\"name\"`\r\n    53\t\tStatus     string `json:\"status\"`\r\n    54\t\tCached     bool   `json:\"cached\"`\r\n    55\t\tDurationMS int64  `json:\"duration_ms\"`\r\n    56\t\tCacheKey   string `json:\"cache_key\"`\r\n    57\t}\r\n    58\t\r\n    59\ttype BuildReport struct {\r\n    60\t\tPipeline string              `json:\"pipeline\"`\r\n    61\t\tTargets  []BuildTargetReport `json:\"targets\"`\r\n    62\t\tSummary  BuildSummary        `json:\"summary\"`\r\n    63\t}\r\n    64\t\r\n    65\ttype BuildSummary struct {\r\n    66\t\tTotal      int   `json:\"total\"`\r\n    67\t\tBuilt      int   `json:\"built\"`"]
